OL,3,GNEWSAHorse lover's final wish fulfilled
OL,4,Awith pony visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lifelong horse lover was able to
OL,7,Fspend time with two ponies in the final
OL,8,Fdays of her life after a community
OL,9,Fappeal helped arrange a surprise
OL,10,Fhospice visit.
OL,12,FDenise Lee, from Ashington, West
OL,13,FSussex, had loved horses since
OL,14,Fchildhood and volunteered with the
OL,15,FRiding for the Disabled Association but
OL,16,Fher cancer diagnosis meant she could no
OL,17,Flonger ride.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
