OL,3,GNEWSAHorse lover's final wish fulfilled
OL,4,Awith pony visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile receiving care at St Barnabas
OL,7,FHouse in Worthing last month, she told
OL,8,Fthe hospice's staff she would love to
OL,9,Ftouch a horse and experience the
OL,10,F"horsey smell" again.
OL,12,FA healthcare assistant suggested trying
OL,13,Fto make the wish happen and Joanne,
OL,14,FDenise's daughter, appealed for help
OL,15,Fthrough local Facebook community
OL,16,Fgroups.
